abstract: >-
  Code and aggregate data for a cross-source audit of seven public Model Context
  Protocol registries: declaration-plane and code-plane readings of 100,688
  normalised repository listings, descriptor divergence, declaration coverage,
  single-registry listing concentration, and default-branch movement behind
  declared-frozen records.

